=== strace-log-merge ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Finds all STRACE_LOG.PID files, adds PID prefix to every line, then combines
and sorts them, and prints result to standard output.

It is assumed that STRACE_LOGs were produced by strace with -tt[t] option
which prints timestamps (otherwise sorting won't do any good).


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  strace-log-merge STRACE_LOG


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  STRACE_LOG
